 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Common refinement by the product ideal",
 "statement": "The constructed $d_{\\mathcal I}$ and $d_{\\mathcal J}$ are morphisms over\n$X$. If both ideals restrict to the unit ideal on an open $U$, the product\nblow-up and both maps restrict to the identity over $U$.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-lem-nagata-sketch-blowups/cor-nagata-blowup-product-common-refinement.md",
  "place": "node cor-nagata-blowup-product-common-refinement, order 125"
 },
 "stmt_deps": [
